# Monorepo layout

- `apps/web` (`@selecta/web`) — Next.js UI deployable (port 3000)
- `apps/api` (`@selecta/api`) — Next.js API deployable (port 3001)
- `packages/*` (`@selecta/catalog`, `@selecta/db`, `@selecta/library`, `@selecta/submissions`, `@selecta/agentics`, `@selecta/ui`, `@selecta/eslint-config`) — shared libraries. `@selecta/db` is Postgres client + schema + migrations only; music domain lives in `@selecta/library` and notes/proposals plus the resolve/decide/apply pipeline live in `@selecta/submissions`. NL parse lives in `@selecta/agentics/submission-parser`. **`@selecta/agentics` owns code that talks to a model.** Code that writes to Postgres, or defines a durable identity for a Postgres row, belongs in a domain package.

Put deployable apps under `apps/`. Put shared domain/UI libraries under `packages/`. Import `@selecta/*` from apps; do not duplicate domain logic inside app folders.

Use **oxfmt** for formatting (`pnpm format` / `pnpm format:check`). Shared ESLint lives in `@selecta/eslint-config`.
